<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Money</h1>
<p>Money is a very important part of the game. It is used for everything from 
buying items and food to renting storage space and paying teachers.
</p><p>You can drop money or give money to other players, using the same commands you 
would with any other object in the game:
</p>
<pre>give 20 silver pieces to sam
drop 17 iron pieces
</pre>
<p>These are the standard conversion rates for the standard coins:
</p>
<pre>1 platinum piece (pp) = 8 gold pieces (gp)
1 gold piece (gp)     = 8 silver pieces (sp)
1 silver piece (sp)   = 8 copper pieces (cp)
1 copper piece (cp)   = 8 iron pieces (ip)
</pre>
<p>Shops give change, so any coin will do when you buy something.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
